#### [MODIFY] [Sidebar.tsx](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/frontend/src/components/Sidebar.tsx) & [App.tsx](file:///e:/WEB/LeadGrowth/frontend/src/App.tsx)
- Add routes for `/billing`, `/security-center`, and `/invite/accept`.

